<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">只答官方原文里写过的事 · 语料 4 份 / 25 个段落 · 核查 {{collectedAt}}</view>
  <view class="qa-title">升学与实习问答</view>

  <view class="qa-note">
    检索到官方原文后由 <text class="qa-strong">AI 依据原文解释</text>，每句含日期、条件或数字的话都要带出处编号；
    <text class="qa-strong">核不到出处的回答不会显示</text>，会退回原文摘录。澄清与拒答仍由规则触发。
    回答不构成录取或报考资格判断。
  </view>

  <view class="qa-ask">
    <input id="qa-input" class="qa-input" value="{{question}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="例如：转段考核包括哪几个部分？" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="onAsk" />
    <view id="qa-ask" class="qa-ask-btn" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="onAsk">提问</view>
  </view>
  <view class="qa-chips">
    <view
      class="qa-chip"
      wx:for="{{examples}}"
      wx:key="*this"
      hover-class="pressed"
      data-value="{{item}}"
      bindtap="onExample"
    >{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{hasResult}}">
    <view class="qa-question">{{asked}}</view>

    <block wx:if="{{result.behavior === 'answer'}}">
      <view class="qa-pending" wx:if="{{modelPhase === 'loading'}}">
        <view class="qa-pending-label">正在依据官方原文生成解释…</view>
        <view class="qa-pending-note">模型只能用下面这些原文段落；核对不上出处的回答不会显示。</view>
        <view id="qa-cancel" class="qa-pending-cancel" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="onCancelModel">取消，直接看原文</view>
      </view>

      <block wx:else>
        <view class="qa-answer {{modelRefused ? 'qa-answer-guard' : ''}}">
          <view class="qa-answer-label">{{modelLabel}}</view>
          <view class="qa-answer-text">{{modelText}}</view>
          <view class="qa-answer-note">{{modelNote}}</view>
        </view>
      </block>

      <view class="qa-source" wx:for="{{result.citations}}" wx:key="passageId" wx:for-item="cite" wx:for-index="citeIndex">
        <view class="qa-source-head">
          <view class="qa-source-title">
            <text class="qa-source-badge" wx:if="{{modelPhase === 'ready'}}">[S{{citeIndex + 1}}]</text>{{cite.title}}
          </view>
          <view class="qa-source-meta">{{cite.documentNumber}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="qa-source-quote">{{cite.quote}}</view>
        <view class="qa-source-meta">发布主体 {{cite.issuer}} · 发布 {{cite.publishedAt}} · 适用 {{cite.applicableRegion}} · 核查 {{cite.collectedAt}}</view>
        <view class="qa-source-foot">
          <view class="qa-source-url">{{cite.sourceUrl}}</view>
          <view class="qa-copy" hover-class="pressed" data-url="{{cite.sourceUrl}}" bindtap="onCopySource">复制原文链接 ›</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="qa-actions" wx:if="{{modelPhase === 'fallback'}}">
        <view id="qa-retry" class="qa-retry" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="onRetryModel">重试 AI 解释</view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <block wx:else>
      <view class="qa-guard">
        <view class="qa-guard-label">{{result.behavior === 'clarify' ? '需要先确认' : '无法核实'}}</view>
        <view class="qa-guard-text">{{result.answer}}</view>
        <view class="qa-guard-note">{{result.note}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="qa-choices" wx:if="{{result.choices.length > 0}}">
        <view
          class="qa-choice"
          wx:for="{{result.choices}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          hover-class="pressed"
          data-value="{{item}}"
          bindtap="onChoice"
        >{{item}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="qa-links" wx:if="{{result.links.length > 0}}">
        <view class="qa-source-title">官方入口</view>
        <view
          class="qa-choice"
          wx:for="{{result.links}}"
          wx:key="url"
          hover-class="pressed"
          data-url="{{item.url}}"
          bindtap="onCopySource"
        >复制链接：{{item.label}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </block>

  <view class="quiet qa-foot">
    回答来自 4 份官方材料的 25 个逐字段落，不包含岗位、薪资与录取分数线——问这些会直接告诉你「无法核实」。
    澄清与拒答由规则触发；模型只解释检索到的原文，日期、条件与数字必须能核到出处，否则退回原文摘录。
  </view>
  <view id="back-from-qa" class="qa-back" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</view>
</view>
